Week 2 Objectives: Install and become proficient with AWS CLI. Learn and practice with Amazon EC2 service. Tasks to be carried out this week: Day Task Start Date Completion Date Reference Material 2,3 - Practice: + Create AWS account + Install &amp; configure AWS CLI + How to use AWS CLI 15/06/2026 16/06/2026 https://cloudjourney.awsstudygroup.com/ 4,5 - Learn basic EC2: + Instance types + AMI + EBS + &hellip; - SSH connection methods to EC2 - Learn about Elastic IP 17/06/2026 18/06/2026 https://cloudjourney.awsstudygroup.com/ 6 - Practice: + Launch an EC2 instance + Connect via SSH + Attach an EBS volume 19/06/2026 19/06/2026 https://cloudjourney.awsstudygroup.com/ Week 2 Achievements: Used AWS CLI to perform basic operations such as:
Check account &amp; configuration information Retrieve the list of regions View EC2 service Create and manage key pairs Check information about running services &hellip; Acquired the ability to connect between the web interface and CLI to manage AWS resources in parallel.
&hellip;
